        <mxCell id="noteLoop" value="PERMISSION REQUEST &#8212; NEW, both branches&lt;br&gt;A viewer who fails the gate asks the owner for access. The owner sees it&lt;br&gt;on their next visit &#8212; the system never sends &#183; rn-j-permission-request.md" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E8E8EE;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontColor=#5B5B66;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
